+   * What it does enforce: the grant must name THIS session, its task, workflow and
+   * step, must agree with the step's recorded visit count, and must not have
+   * expired — re-checked on every create, not only when issued. A settled session
+   * issues nothing and invalidates what it already issued. The session id is the
+   * binding a caller cannot choose: a later entry of the same step is a new
+   * session, so a grant cannot be replayed into it.
